## Context
Comparison script that runs all PDF converter backends on the same test
documents and produces a side-by-side quality report focused on table extraction.

## Actions
1. Select 3 test PDFs from experiments/data/rag_work/pdfs/ (easy, hard, hardest)
2. Script: experiments/compare_converters.py runs each backend, extracts tables
3. Metrics: tables detected, row/column accuracy, cross-page continuity,
   Vietnamese diacritics, wall-clock time
4. Save per-backend markdown outputs for manual inspection

## Exit criteria
- Script runs on at least 3 backends (grobid + 2 new)
- Produces comparison summary to stdout
- Results inform default CORPUS_CONVERT choice in Makefile
